{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl9\pnlcrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \qc\widctlpar \f4\fs20\lang19 {\ul\lang2057 THE FILMCALCULATOR  (Version 3.0)
\par }{\lang2057  for the Psion 3A paltop computer
\par }\pard \widctlpar {\lang2057 
\par GENERAL:
\par The Filmcalculator is a calculator for people working in the film business. The calculator is mainly useful for D.O.P.\rquote s, camera-operators, -assistants,  clapperloaders and gaffers . It will help you in preparation and on the set.
\par Feel free to distribute or copy  this program but don't change anything without permission from the author.
\par 
\par INSTALLATION FROM FLOPPY DISK:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-283\li283\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnstart1\pnindent283\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}{\lang2057 Connect the Psion with a PC and use Rcom or Psiwin to transfer the files to the Psion. 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Copy the main program Film30.opa in an \\APP directory on the internal disk or on a SSD card.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Create a directory called \\APP\\FILMCALC\\ on the same disk or SSD card and place the file  Sysdat.002 and all files with *.OVL ,*.DBF and *.FON in that directory.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Install the program from the system screen via the Applications menu or  with Psion-I.
\par }\pard \widctlpar {\lang2057 
\par Important!!! The name of the owner should be entered in the system screen  / info / owner menu before using the program! Afterwards changing this name will make your registration invalid.
\par 
\par UPDATING FROM AN OLDER VERSION:
\par Remove the old Filmcalculator icon from the system screen with "Menu Applications - Remove". 
\par Delete the old Film??e.opa file and all the old  files in the \\app\\filmcalc\\ directory }{\ul\lang2057 except the *.CFG files}{\lang2057 . 
\par 
\par }{\b\lang2057 Never delete the Filmcalc.cfg file on the internal disk!}{\lang2057  
\par ========================================================
\par 
\par Proceed as descibed above in " Installation" 
\par 
\par USING THE PROGRAM:
\par The program has help lines at the bottom and right side of the screens.
\par In the mainscreen press the "Menu" key to open the menus, select a calculation with the "Arrow"  keys and press "Enter". Version 3.0 has some new keys in the result calculation screens but the older keys (spacebar for recalculation and Esc for back to mai
n menu) are still functioning.
\par Please note: the short cut keys in the main menus don't need the Psion key. E.g pressing "S" will bring you immediately to the Setup menu.
\par 
\par SHAREWARE NOTES:
\par You can try the program 14 days. After that period you should enter a special registration number or the program will stop. Information about registering the program will show up at the program start up until you enter the right number.
\par 
\par HOW TO REGISTER THE PROGRAM:
\par Fill in the Registration form supplied with this program and fax this form to +31 20 4082339
\par 
\par HOW TO PAY:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20 1.\tab}}\pard \fi-283\li283\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent283\pnhang{\pntxta .}}{\lang2057 The easiest way is to use your creditcard. Fill in the registration form, sign it and fax this form to me.  
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20 2.\tab}Use the CompuServe shareware database (GO SWREG program ID=5315). 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20 3.\tab}Send an  international money order for the equivalent of 275 Dutch guilders ($175 or 100 UK pounds) to the address below. As soon as I receive your payment I will e-mail or fax you your number.
\par }\pard \widctlpar {\lang2057 
\par IN PROGRESS:
\par }{\f14\lang2057 Light value lamp lookup functions
\par More conversions
\par Camera equipment lookup database
\par If you have any suggestions please let me know!\page CHANGES IN VERSION 3.0 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}}\pard \fi-283\li283\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnstart1\pnindent283\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}{\f14\lang2057 Most screens are changed. Added + and - keys to most calculations to improve calculation speed and handling.

\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Corrected some bugs.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Added more film/video formats 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Setup is accessible from the result calculation screens
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Extended timecode calculations.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs20 \'b7\tab}Added Lamp database and lookup. (light.dbf)
\par }\pard \widctlpar {\f14\lang2057 
\par This database is in a normal Psion format  You can add and change the data or create several different databases. (Please make a backup of the original file before changing.) 
\par  If you have added or created a new database please send me a copy. I will make it available to others on my web site.
\par 
\par CHANGES IN VERSION 3.01
\par Fixed the increment key in the Depth of field calculation (imperial setup only)
\par }{\lang2057 
